title: LinOTP Source
agents: linotp_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 This service reports the health of the LinOTP REST special agent run
 itself (login, /monitoring/tokens query). It is created on the host
 running the special agent, alongside the per-realm/per-resolver services.

 Goes CRIT when the agent run failed (login error, HTTP error, timeout,
 unreachable instance) with the underlying error message as the service
 output. Goes OK when the run succeeded, reporting the number of realms
 found and the query duration.

item:
 None. One "LinOTP Source" service is created per configured host.

discovery:
 One "LinOTP Source" service is discovered on the host running the
 special agent.
